  "content": "<h4>此資源包為工具上的附魔光輝添加了<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>發光效果</strong>，</span>使其外觀更加鮮豔時尚。</h4><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/enchantment-glows/showcases/enchantment-glows-with-hold-my-items-mod.webp\" alt=\"Sinnelar - 附魔光輝 Minecraft 資源包展示（搭配 Hold My Items 模組）\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/enchantment-glows/showcases/enchantment-glows-bow.gif\" alt=\"Minecraft 附魔弓箭發光動畫\" width=\"50%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/enchantment-glows/showcases/enchantment-glows-crossbow.gif\" alt=\"Minecraft 附魔十字弓箭發光動畫\" width=\"50%\">\n<br></p><p>此資源包完全適用於&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">原版 Minecraft 1.21.4 - 26.2</span></strong></p><p><strong>附魔工具清單：</strong></p><ul>\n<li>劍</li>\n<li>斧頭</li>\n<li>鎬</li>\n<li>鏟子</li>\n<li>鋤頭</li>\n<li>矛</li>\n<li>狼牙棒 3D</li>\n<li>弓</li>\n<li>十字弓</li>\n<li>釣竿</li>\n<li>三叉戟 (1.21.4+)</li>\n<li>盾牌 (1.21.4+)</li>\n</ul><p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">低於 1.21.4 的版本需安裝 CIT Resewn<br></span></strong></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcit-resewn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/enchantment-glows/ui/b-ct-d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"177\" height=\"177\"></span></strong></a></p><p><strong>鳴謝：</strong></p><ul>\n<li>是的，靈感來自&nbsp;<strong>Actions &amp; Stuff</strong></li>\n</ul><hr><div>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3122\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/sinnelar-affiliates/sparked-host-promo-code-2026-minecraft-sinnelar.webp\" alt=\"Sparked Host 促銷代碼 2026 - 使用代碼 Sinnelar 享 Minecraft 伺服器託管 25% 折扣\" width=\"100%\">\n  </a>\n</div>",
